<title>LEBANON: Solidere shareholders approve 25 cents dividend.</title>
<headline>Solidere shareholders approve 25 cents dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders at Lebanon's biggest company Solidere approved on Monday a 25 cents dividend for 1996, 25 percent up on the 1995 dividend.</p>
<p>&quot;Shareholders agreed at an annual ordinary assembly today to distribute a 25 cents dividend,&quot; company spokesperson Rashid Fayed told Reuters.</p>
<p>--Beirut editorial (9611) 345723 345740 602057</p>
</text>
